esung","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daesung"}},"Q22773742":{"id":"Q22773742","name":"Moon Sua","ko":"문수아","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Moon Soo-ah","Moon Su-a","Moonsua"],"birth":"1999-09-09","death":"","birthplace":"Cheongju","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["pop singer","singer","rapper"],"debut":"2015","agencies":[{"name":"Mystic Story","korean":true,"id":"Q15509774","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q108888399","name":"Billlie","start":"2021","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/a_us_noom/","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/3JYrF4xPpvNbgb9gV0z8bx","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/05efe6a1-1410-43c1-a31b-3bfeeca46863"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/Moon_SuA_Fancam_220902.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Moon_SuA_Fancam_220902.png","author":"mang2goon","license":"CC BY 3.0"},"bio":null},"Q30196590":{"id":"Q30196590","name":"Kim Se-yong","ko":"김세용","birthName":"김세용","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1991-11-20","death":"","birthplace":"Busan","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","rapper","actor"],"debut":"2011","agencies":[{"name":"Kakao M","korean":true,"id":"Q625975","start":"","end":""},{"name":"Yoshimoto Kogyo Holdings","korean":false,"id":"Q3272007","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q487111","name":"Myname","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/sy_911120/","x":"https://x.com/MYNAME_KYong"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Kim Se-yong is a South Korean singer, rapper, dancer, and actor. Signed to H2 Media, he made his debut with idol quintet Myname in 2011. Kim began his acting career two years prior, appearing on the television series Green Coach. He released his first mini-album Connection independent from Myname in Japan in May 2019.","title":"Kim Se-yong","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kim_Se-yong"}},"Q485678":{"id":"Q485678","name":"Kim Jun","ko":"김준","birthName":"김형준","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Kim Hyeong-jun","Kim Joon","Kim Hyung-joon"],"birth":"1984-02-03","death":"","birthplace":"Gwacheon","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor","model","television actor","film actor"],"debut":"2007","agencies":[],"groups":[],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kimj0203/","x":"https://x.com/kj0203"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Kim Joon is a South Korean rapper and actor who rose to stardom with his portrayal of one of the famous F4 members in the 2009 hit drama Boys Over Flowers.","title":"Kim Joon","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kim_Joon"}},"Q489006":{"id":"Q489006","name":"Uee","ko":"유이","birthName":"김유진","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["U-ie","Kim Yu-jin","Yu-jin Kim"],"birth":"1988-04-09","death":"","birthplace":"Cheongju","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor","model"],"debut":"2009","agencies":[{"name":"Pledis Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q45282","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q389067","name":"After School","start":"2009","end":"2015"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kim_uieing49/","x":"https://x.com/uiiiie","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCf_KravnkJjsABuuBIhcwfA","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/bcd59121-b2b2-4010-b22e-9cf04cf108c4"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Kim Yu-jin, known professionally as Uee (유이; sometimes romanized as U-ie), is a South Korean singer and actress. She is best known for being a former member of South Korean girl group After School from 2009 to 2017, and has acted in various television dramas including Queen Seondeok (2009), Ojakgyo Family (2011), Jeon Woo-chi (2012), Golden Rainbow (2013), High Society (2015), Hogu's Love (2015), Marriage Contract (2016), and My Only One (2018). On May 31, 2017, Uee left After School and its agency, Pledis Entertainment.","title":"Uee","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uee"}},"Q489838":{"id":"Q489838","name":"Leeteuk","ko":"이특","birthName":"박정수","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1983-07-01","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","television presenter","actor","film actor","pianist","songwriter"],"debut":"2005","agencies":[{"name":"SM Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q483938","start":"","end":""},{"name":"Label SJ","korean":true,"id":"Q28310645","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q239693","name":"Super Junior","start":"2005","end":""},{"id":"Q2625142","name":"Super Junior-T","start":"2007","end":""},{"id":"Q700431","name":"Super Junior-Happy","start":"2008","end":""},{"id":"Q140936337","name":"Super Junior-83z","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/xxteukxx/","x":"https://x.com/special1004","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTphzdoK4JCjmkWBFEoIeeA","tiktok":"https://www.tiktok.com/@sj.leeteuk","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1rVpXgPDVeUXPKKqVEnAGb","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/a044831d-0a44-4548-a1d5-75d66ca5c2b6"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c9/171115_%EC%8A%88%ED%8D%BC%EC%A3%BC%EB%8B%88%EC%96%B4_%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B9.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:171115_%EC%8A%88%ED%8D%BC%EC%A3%BC%EB%8B%88%EC%96%B4_%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B9.jpg","author":"Daegil yoo","license":"CC BY 3.0"},"bio":{"text":"Park Jeong-su, known professionally as Leeteuk (이특; [itʰɯk̚]), is a South Korean singer, songwriter, presenter, radio personality, and actor. He debuted as the leader of the boy band Super Junior in November 2005 and since then has participated in its subgroups Super Junior-T, Super Junior-Happy, Super Junior-L.S.S., and Super Junior-83z. He began his career as a television presenter on the music show M! Countdown. He is best known for his role in presenting Strong Heart, Star King, The Best Cooking Secrets, I Can See Your Voice, and Idol Star Athletics Championships.","title":"Leeteuk","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leeteuk"}},"Q4923630":{"id":"Q4923630","name":"Kaede Hashimoto","ko":"하시모토 가에데","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1997-01-21","death":"","birthplace":"Kanagawa Prefecture","nationality":["Japan"],"height":null,"occupations":["model","singer","tarento"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q50821732","name":"Honey Popcorn","start":"2019","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kaede_h0121/","x":"https://x.com/kaede_h0121","tiktok":"https://www.tiktok.com/@1021kr","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/324af51d-149e-4ac7-9969-099af07b18e4"},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q494190":{"id":"Q494190","name":"Jang Na-ra","ko":"장나라","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Jang Nara","Jang Na Ra","Nara Jang","JJang Na Ra","Jang Na-ra (장나라/張娜拉)"],"birth":"1981-03-18","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["actor","singer","film actor","model","record producer","songwriter"],"debut":"2001","agencies":[],"groups":[],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/nara0318/","x":"https://x.com/narajjang318","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYT1BFgicF-F4Pu87sjsfmg","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/303b3ad8-1a31-492f-9032-61f31064535d"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Jang Na-ra is a South Korean actress and singer who has been active in both the South Korean and Chinese entertainment industries since 2001. She first gained wide recognition with her studio album Sweet Dream in 2002, and further rose to prominence for starring in television series Successful Story of a Bright Girl (2002), You Are My Destiny (2014), Hello Monster (2015), Go Back (2017), The Last Empress (2018–2019), VIP (2019), and Good Partner (2024).","title":"Jang Na-ra","url":"http